### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- SaaS agents frequently have access to:
- - Stripe API keys (billing mutations)
- - Auth provider admin tokens (user management)
- - Customer PII (names, emails, usage data)
- Before installing any skill for a SaaS agent, run `clawtrix-security-audit` first. The risk multiplier for billing access is 3x — a MEDIUM-flagged skill becomes HIGH risk.
